# A call shows what its asker opened before asking: the file at the line it pointed at, and the
# changes of its checkout, on the desk's Calls page.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies calls-opened.json
project storefront shop-site
patch site-fix.diff
chat Wren
title "Cart totals a cent off"
say "Some orders come out a cent off at checkout. Find out why."
settle 8
front Wren
settle 2
snap opened-desk
click 835,70
settle 2
snap calls-opened
